    <p style="margin-top: 16px">
      A TCP output peer that accepts and never reads (receive buffer 4 KiB), with the tick source as fast as the task
      answers and <code>max_seconds = 30</code>. Field 0.2.0 hung once the buffers filled: no cycles, and its 30 s run
      cap never ran; it was killed at 60 s. Field 0.3.0 ended at 7.7 s with <code>sink-error</code> and exit 1, after
      70,428 delivered outputs, with the checkpoint kept.
    </p>
    <p class="tiny" style="margin-top: 10px">
      All flood numbers from stall.csv, lock.csv, backlog.csv and the run directories in{' '}
