    </p>
    <p style="margin-top: 16px">
      What it does not cover: a flood on a network, which Field does not run; a <code>cmd:</code> source or sink, which
      is the operator&#39;s program and not the task; a source faster than Field can read in one period; a backlog under{' '}
      <code>queue</code>; and overload of the processor, which is the CPU share&#39;s job.
    </p>

